## Toy Implementation Scope

This code does not fully reproduce the original Hybrid GRASP-GA algorithm.

Instead, it implements the simplified core decision logic:

1. Prioritize highly constrained orders
2. Evaluate feasible warehouses for each order
3. Calculate transportation cost and shortage cost
4. Assign the order to the lowest-cost warehouse
5. Update warehouse inventory after assignment
6. Adjust alpha to balance transportation and inventory shortage costs
